{"id":"n90526-2-8","stage":5,"title":"아늑하다 · 舒适","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90526-2-8-1","ko":"날씨가 아늑한 걸 보니 벌써 봄이 오나 봐요.","zh":"看天气这么宜人，看来春天已经到了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"아늑한","meaning":"舒适","explanation":"아늑하다：舒适；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아늑하다","audio":"/audio/d09df471bf6e845a5852.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90526","senseId":"2","lemma":"아늑하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아늑한","audio":"/audio/b9288c5695fdfe8208b6.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"봄이","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봄이","audio":"/audio/4ba55e409fa97ee9abab.mp3"}},{"text":"오나","meaning":"到","explanation":"오다：到；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"19","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오나","audio":"/audio/ef95ee8ee12ea340a6ec.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"d09df471bf6e845a","term":"아늑하다","zh":"舒适","audio":"/audio/d09df471bf6e845a5852.mp3","entryId":"90526","definition":"有暖和而温馨的感觉。","pronunciation":["아느카다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测；看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"某个时间或季节等来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2f26273598cfa0c7a0c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90526-2-8-2","ko":"맞아요, 요새 날씨가 참 좋아졌죠.","zh":"对呀，最近天气确实好多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아요,","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}},{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아졌죠.","meaning":"那样就好了；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아졌죠","audio":"/audio/49497c94f1562c8fed5d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","defini